us="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SENO, SHOICHIRO</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI HIROYUKI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SAITO YUZURU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>SENO SHOICHIRO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOBAYASHI, HIROYUKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAITO, YUZURU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SENO, SHOICHIRO</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>An inputted packet is divided to one or more ATM cells by a cell generating circuit (2). Cell header setting sections (12-1 to 12-n) refer to specific fields in the packet contained in the ATM cells in unit of an AAL frame and set in the ATM cell headers the values of the specific ATM cells corresponding to the values of the specific fields in the packet in the specific fields in the ATM cells collated to the specific fields in the packet.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>Selon cette invention, un paquet émis est divisé en une ou plusieurs cellules ATM par un générateur de cellules (2). En l'occurrence, des zones d'en-tête de cellules (12-1 à 12-n) désignant des champs spécifiques appartenant au paquet contenu dans les cellules ATM, sous forme d'une trame AAL, viennent définir, dans les en-têtes de cellules ATM, les valeurs qui, pour les cellules ATM considérées, correspondent aux valeurs des champs spécifiques du paquet, et ce, dans les zones spécifiques des cellules ATM telles qu'elles ont été réunies pour constituer les zones spécifiques du paquet.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>